EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "The trainers here have secret\n"
	.string "motives.\p"
	.string "If you win, they may tell you some\n"
	.string "deep secrets about ECRUTEAK.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Whew, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "You did great!\p"
	.string "I was cowering in the corner out of\n"
	.string "pure terror!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_SagePing2Intro::
	.string "Can you inflict any damage on our\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_SagePing2Defeat::
	.string "Ah! Well done!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_SagePing2::
	.string "We use only ghost-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "No normal-type attack can harm\n"
	.string "them!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_MediumGraceIntro::
	.string "Stumped by our invisible floor?\p"
	.string "Defeat me if you want a hint!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_MediumGraceDefeat::
	.string "Wha-what?$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_MediumGrace::
	.string "Fine. I shall tell you the secret of\n"
	.string "the invisible floor.\p"
	.string "The path is right before our eyes!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_SagePingIntro::
	.string "I spent the spring with my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Then summer, fall and winter...\p"
	.string "Then spring came again. We have\n"
	.string "lived together for a long time.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_SagePingDefeat::
	.string "Wins and losses, I experienced both.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_SagePing::
	.string "Where did POKéMON come from?$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_MediumMarthaIntro::
	.string "I shall win!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_MediumMarthaDefeat::
	.string "I, I, I lost!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_MediumMartha::
	.string "The one who wants to win most--will!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderMorty2Intro::
	.string "Good of you to have come.\p"
	.string "Here in ECRUTEAK, POKéMON have\n"
	.string "been revered.\p"
	.string "It’s said that legendary POKéMON\n"
	.string "will appear to the truly powerful\l"
	.string "trainers.\p"
	.string "I believed that tale, so I have\n"
	.string "secretly trained here all my life.\p"
	.string "As a result, I can now see what\n"
	.string "others cannot.\p"
	.string "Just a bit more...\p"
	.string "With a little more, I could see\n"
	.string "a future in which I meet the\l"
	.string "legendary POKéMON.\p"
	.string "You’re going to help me reach that\n"
	.string "level!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderMorty2Defeat::
	.string "I’m not good enough yet...\p"
	.string "All right. This BADGE is yours.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the FOGBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderMorty2_1::
	.string "I see...\p"
	.string "Your journey has taken you to\n"
	.string "faraway places.\p"
	.string "And you have witnessed much more\n"
	.string "than I.\p"
	.string "I envy you for that...$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderMorty2_2::
	.string "By having FOGBADGE, POKéMON\n"
	.string "up to L50 will obey you.\p"
	.string "Also, POKéMON that know SURF will be\n"
	.string "able to use that move anytime.\p"
	.string "I want you to have this too.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderMorty2_3::
	.string "It’s SHADOW BALL.\n"
	.string "It causes damage and may reduce\l"
	.string "SPCL.DEF.\p"
	.string "Use it if it appeals to you.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "ECRUTEAK CITY POKEMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: MORTY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "ECRUTEAK CITY POKEMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: MORTY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER} CARLOS$"

EcruteakCity_Interior5_Text_Sign1_3::
